    "sample-002/intro": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "以步行和街区观察记录城市变化，关心人在空间里如何生活。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 27
    },
    "sample-002/highlight/s2-h1": {
      "kind": "highlight",
      "source_id": "s2-h1",
      "text": "一座城市最诚实的部分，往往在步行速度里。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 20,
      "created_at": 1774051200
    },
    "sample-002/highlight/s2-h2": {
      "kind": "highlight",
      "source_id": "s2-h2",
      "text": "街道不是通道，它也是停留发生的地方。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 18,
      "created_at": 1774051200
    },
    "sample-002/thought/s2-r1": {
      "kind": "thought",
      "source_id": "s2-r1",
      "text": "这本书让我重新注意每天经过却没有看见的路。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 21,
      "created_at": 1774051200
    },
    "sample-001/title": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "看见选择",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 4
    },
    "sample-001/author": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "林舟",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 2
    },
    "sample-001/intro": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "从日常选择出发，讨论事实、假设与判断之间的距离。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 24
    },
    "sample-001/highlight/s1-h1": {
      "kind": "highlight",
      "source_id": "s1-h1",
      "text": "事实不会替我们做决定，但会缩小自欺的空间。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 21,
      "created_at": 1768176000
    },
    "sample-001/highlight/s1-h2": {
      "kind": "highlight",
      "source_id": "s1-h2",
      "text": "先写下你相信什么，再去寻找会推翻它的证据。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 21,
      "created_at": 1771372800
    },
    "sample-001/thought/s1-r1": {
      "kind": "thought",
      "source_id": "s1-r1",
      "text": "今年我真正需要的不是更多建议，而是一套能暴露假设的检查方式。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 30,
      "created_at": 1771372800
    },
    "sample-001/thought/s1-r2": {
      "kind": "thought",
      "source_id": "s1-r2",
      "text": "以后做重要决定时，先保留一次反方陈述。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 19,
      "created_at": 1771372800
    },
    "sample-005/title": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "重新学习提问",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 6
